<title>USA: Infoseek names chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>Infoseek names chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Infoseek Corp said Thursday it has promoted Leonard LeBlanc to the newly created position of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>LeBlanc who was also added to Infoseek's board of directors, joined Infoseek in 1996 as executive vice president and chief financial officer and will continue to serve as chief financial officer.</p>
